{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All characters in this game are eighteen years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of alien abduction. Find a way out from a UFO with easy controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Synopsis]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with a peculiar rumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people claim that they saw a UFO in late night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To Chisato, it was just a rumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She did not believe it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, she couldn't sleep and walked to a convenience store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little did she know, she was met with the UFO on her way back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon she got abducted into the UFO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she woke up in the UFO,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a pig-like alien greeted her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chisato starts her journey to find a way out of UFO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227350/extras/7d3dfac1a99d30154abe8c97440b85ff.avif?t=1750141195\" width=500 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Easy Control With D-Pad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chisato explores inside the UFO to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the UFO is filled with security robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once they find her, they will alert others and follow her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she takes too much damage from them, she will pass out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ruining her escape plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple security robots might follow Chisato.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But they will give up once she is out of their territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, distract, and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore inside the UFO and collect important items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to get out of the UFO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Event]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the security robots get her, Chisato will pass out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XXX scenes will be unlocked when the aliens get capture her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once unlocked, the XXX scenes can be watched again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from the item tab.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227350?t=1750141195","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3227350?t=1750141195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227350/64024136ddecc56b4bd27556f93cec3d373e7076/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750141195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227350/64024136ddecc56b4bd27556f93cec3d373e7076/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750141195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game includes the following adult content:\r\n-Nudity.\r\n-Numerous nudity and sexual acts.\r\n-Sexual acts by machine.\r\n-Non-consensual sexual acts.\r\n-Physical violence\r\n-Body modification\r\n\r\nThe game contains many depictions of nonconsensual sexual acts.\r\nThere are many sexual scenes involving physical restrai